# Poniente — 6 wakings/day (UTC) at :36 of hours 1,5,9,13,17,21 — 10-agent qwen3.8:27b 4-hour interleave (24-min gaps, staggered 2026-09-26 so local Ollama never sees concurrent wakes); poll Telegram commands every 5 min
